  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEVELOPMENT STUDIES ASSOCIATION&#xa0;IRELAND</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSAI has received core funding from Irish Aid since 2013. This funding has not only facilitated the reconstitution of DSAI from a purely voluntary body to a more professionalized network, it has also facilitated the expansion and consolidation of the network and its activities. This substantial investment has allowed the network to build capacity in key areas in the development studies sector and respond effectively to COVID-19 pandemic, including through the publication of two open-access books in 2020 and 2022 on the impacts of, and responses to, COVID-19 in the global south.</narrative>
  </description>
